#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:5
#: f0a40e4847d2417e9cdee2ffdc537112
msgid "Antenna Design Overview"
msgstr "天线设计概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:7
#: e0e5fb8db1c847998599a6910e163f8a
msgid ""
"This article provides an overview of the fundamental principles of antenna "
"design. Antenna design is an important factor in using UAVs over extended "
"range and where there are obstructed views. While this is not directly "
"related to Antenna Tracking/autopilots, it may be useful for some readers."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍天线设计的基本原理。天线设计是在延长距离飞行或视线受阻情况下使用无人机的重要因素。虽然这与天线追踪/飞控没有直接关系，但对部分读者可能有用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:20
#: 9542c8ec191d497db1f73522b4b03ea0
msgid "Antenna fundamentals"
msgstr "天线基础知识"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:22
#: 1c39efc66093412ca849d1a6d740361e
msgid ""
"When we speak of antenna radiation it also includes the reverse, that is, "
"the antenna 'collecting' radiated energy."
msgstr "我们所说的天线辐射也包括反向情况，即天线「采集」辐射能量。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:25
#: af66bbc7d2d54e74a9818811b8d41636
msgid ""
"Any piece of wire will radiate energy when connected to a source of RF ( "
"Your transmitter or receiver). How WELL it radiates that applied energy is "
"dependent on only two factors:"
msgstr "任何一段导线连接到射频（RF）源（您的遥控器或接收机）时都会辐射能量。其辐射所施加能量的效率仅取决于两个因素："

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:29
#: dacba1807d70478db9038ba7c13bf11d
msgid ""
"That the antenna is resonant at the same frequency as the radio signal "
"applied and"
msgstr "天线与所施加无线电信号的频率谐振，以及"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:31
#: e3680f0edf2e4b0f8e2fc067e00f24fa
msgid ""
"That the feedpoint of the antenna is matched to the impedance of the "
"attached transmitter energy source."
msgstr "天线的馈电点阻抗与所连接发射机能量源的阻抗匹配。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:36
#: 589d39dbbf8046978da353e1eaabfd82
msgid "Maximum energy transfer between source and load ( the antenna)"
msgstr "源与负载（天线）之间的最大能量传输"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:37
#: d9c0e7c3f7254607a3cddd3e649ece79
msgid "occurs ONLY when the load and source impedance's are equal."
msgstr "仅当负载与源阻抗相等时才能实现。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:42
#: 0fb00c70a2bc4f668464bc16a8eb1b07
msgid ""
"How well the antenna radiates that energy in any or all directions, if the "
"above conditions are met, is then only dependent on the antenna design, "
"shape, or style. For example:"
msgstr "在满足上述条件的前提下，天线向任何或所有方向辐射能量的效果仅取决于天线的设计、形状或类型。例如："

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:46
#: 5ebfd0610cd64df4b50ed86f9b1ff698
msgid ""
"A simple vertical 1/4 wave radiator will radiate a doughnut shaped pattern, "
"in all direction of the compass, with low energy upwards and downwards, in "
"the direction of the antenna element."
msgstr "简单的 1/4 波长垂直辐射器会在罗盘所有方向上辐射甜甜圈形方向图，在天线振子方向（即向上和向下）能量较弱。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:49
#: 0a376809a47f4debb6d237ed7b0b04b1
msgid ""
"A yagi type antenna, on the other hand, ( such as your VHF or UHF TV "
"antenna) focuses the energy in a single direction, as would a torch."
msgstr "而 Yagi 类型天线（如 VHF 或 UHF 电视天线）则将能量集中在单一方向，就像手电筒一样。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:52
#: de0309d8e3d844ed84755b410776a2e9
msgid "Antennas do not have gain:"
msgstr "天线没有增益："

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:54
#: 48ccdbc1df5e41e1ab1395d940f0fdde
msgid ""
"They focus the energy to a greater or lesser extent, in a direction of "
"design, but do this by robbing energy from other radiating directions."
msgstr "它们将能量在设计方向上集中，但这是通过从其他辐射方向夺取能量来实现的。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:57
#: 35fa653bc86e4a6bb443e67bdbc95fa5
msgid ""
"Your torch puts more light out the lens end, with nothing out the rear end."
msgstr "您的手电筒从镜头端发出更多光线，而从后端没有光线射出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:59
#: 4192e7c2d000408bb76d296e8629ff4a
msgid ""
"If you remove the reflector from behind the torch bulb, the light is "
"radiated in all directions, omnidirectionally, but is much weaker at any "
"distant point than the focused beam."
msgstr "如果去掉灯泡后面的反射镜，光线将向所有方向全向辐射，但在任何远处点的亮度都远不如聚焦光束。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:67
#: 62ba1849bdd84b58a66751556cd7da11
msgid "Antenna radiation is polarized"
msgstr "天线辐射是有极化方向的"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:69
#: c69e359211c64aa4a01c16787e240501
msgid ""
"That is to say, the radiated electromagnetic wave has a net polarization "
"plane. This is usually either linear or circular (elliptical polarization is"
" also found, but that is simply a mix of the two other types)"
msgstr "即辐射的电磁波具有净极化平面。通常为线性或圆形（也有椭圆极化，但那只是前两种类型的混合）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:74
#: 36a6ec550a2840468a8bf8db28161029
msgid ""
"A 1/4 wave vertical antenna will radiate linearly, with vertical "
"polarization. Placed on its side it will radiate horizontal polarization."
msgstr "1/4 波长垂直天线辐射线性极化，方向为垂直极化。将其侧放则辐射水平极化。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:77
#: f30f2cba4a1444feaf6e5433526ab836
msgid ""
"A Helical antenna (looks like a coil of wire wound in a screw fashion) wound"
" clockwise when viewed from behind will radiate clockwise circular "
"polarization, and vise versa."
msgstr "螺旋天线（看起来像以螺旋方式绕成的线圈）从背面看顺时针绕制，则辐射顺时针圆极化，反之亦然。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:81
#: 1eb6c7420109410dabfb63630e7fd07c
msgid ""
"For reception of maximum energy, the transmitting and receiving antennae "
"must be identically polarized."
msgstr "为了接收最大能量，发射和接收天线必须具有相同的极化方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:84
#: 841521a126be4d50b07a2ed287d4790a
msgid ""
"There is a massive loss of signal ( easily some 30dB, although the "
"theoretical loss is infinite) if one attempts to receive a horizontally "
"polarized signal with a vertically polarized antenna."
msgstr "如果试图用垂直极化天线接收水平极化信号，会有巨大的信号损失（轻易达到约 30dB，理论损失为无穷大）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:87
#: 1350c5841c0b494e807bc04dd663e5bd
msgid ""
"Similarly, there are massive losses if trying to receive a circularly "
"polarized signal with an antenna of the opposite circular sense."
msgstr "同样，如果用圆极化方向相反的天线接收圆极化信号，也会有巨大损失。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:89
#: 6a243e8ef0fa4e2580f51160fbfc19f6
msgid ""
"The odd man out is that there is only a 3db loss between an antenna that is "
"circularly polarized and one that is linear."
msgstr "一个特例是：圆极化天线和线性极化天线之间仅有 3dB 的损失。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:92
#: 421230a3afd34c5a8e453731d9f0c4ff
msgid "You would use circular polarization if:"
msgstr "您应在以下情况下使用圆极化："

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:94
#: 052ba1e7e8734bf9a9e9be0ca1304ce6
msgid ""
"If the two antennas in question could not be made to maintain similar "
"attitudes, such as one in a pitching , rolling aircraft, then there would be"
" unacceptable signal losses as the aircraft banks and pitches."
msgstr "如果两个天线不能保持相同姿态，例如其中一个在俯仰、横滚的飞机上，则当飞机倾斜和俯仰时会产生难以接受的信号损失。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:98
#: 23ee79938ca94d9da183c14f19b6d17e
msgid ""
"So you could use a vertical on the aircraft, and a helical or turnstile, or "
"similar, on the ground segment."
msgstr "因此可以在飞机上使用垂直天线，而在地面段使用螺旋天线、风车天线或类似天线。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:100
#: 3fe39050ab5c4984beffee52f4179ef2
msgid ""
"This way you would only ever experience a 3db maximum loss. ( all assuming "
"good line of sight view)."
msgstr "这样最多只会有 3dB 的损失（前提是良好的视线条件）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:102
#: 8786f8fd0f2d4f0ca7650e236a54569c
msgid ""
"Or you could gain back the 3db loss by fitting a similar circularly "
"polarized antenna on the aircraft, giving the best of both worlds."
msgstr "或者在飞机上安装类似的圆极化天线，从而获得两全其美的效果，弥补那 3dB 的损失。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:104
#: 6c751d203aea49d6b178b4a78b2169fe
msgid ""
"But you actually gain more than that with circular polarization at both "
"ends."
msgstr "但两端都使用圆极化天线，实际上能获得更多好处。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:107
#: 8d290402e2c341b3a123cfc03f6cbde7
msgid ""
"Assume first that the two antennas are simple vertical monopoles, radiating "
"vertically polarized signals."
msgstr "首先假设两个天线都是简单的垂直单极天线，辐射垂直极化信号。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:110
#: 1b09640fa4324790bf7d9c5b1b89140f
msgid ""
"When you are flying, at the flying club, etc, you are probably near some "
"metal structures, the 'hanger' , cars and other vehicles, etc."
msgstr "在飞行时，在飞行俱乐部等场地，附近可能有金属结构、机库、汽车和其他车辆等。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:112
#: 0dc58a8f5bfe49dd81f506cceceb0cbc
msgid ""
"All these structures reflect the same energy you are trying to receive."
msgstr "这些结构都会反射您试图接收的信号。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:114
#: 581889a469c340f1a824b0ac1de3c2d3
msgid ""
"In addition, when the aircraft is low and far, the RF transmitted by the A/C"
" antenna follows two paths to your receiver - One directly, and one via a "
"reflection from the ground, somewhat midway between you and the A/C."
msgstr ""
"此外，当飞机低飞且距离较远时，飞机天线发射的射频信号沿两条路径到达您的接收机——一条是直射路径，另一条是经过您和飞机之间某处地面的反射路径。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:118
#: 44ee0b53d0bd48b9b36d7c023c932c53
msgid ""
"What happens to the reflected wave is that the polarization is changed in "
"unpredictable ways."
msgstr "反射波的极化方式会以不可预测的方式改变。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:120
#: 36bc979cf23c466f85d43e8648645686
msgid ""
"Your receiver ( and antenna) does not know or care where the received energy"
" comes from, so it receives this reflected energy as well."
msgstr "您的接收机（和天线）不知道也不在乎接收到的能量来自何处，因此也会接收到这些反射能量。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:122
#: d471e84fc5e94d929601c79dc64342dc
msgid ""
"These multitude of received waves add constructively and destructively with "
"the main received wave, causing large, short duration, signal drop-outs - a "
"sort of 'flutter' in the signal."
msgstr "这些大量接收到的波与主接收波产生相长和相消叠加，导致大幅度、短时的信号中断——一种信号「抖动」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:126
#: 63f0d1c0309346fe95d5892e14f166a7
msgid ""
"If both antenna are circularly polarized, however, the picture is quite "
"different:"
msgstr "然而，如果两个天线都是圆极化的，情况则大不相同："

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:129
#: 488ba3d460574796b0943987b6ebc11d
msgid ""
"When the circular polarized waveform is reflected , it REVERSES its "
"polarization."
msgstr "当圆极化波形被反射时，其极化方向会发生逆转。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:131
#: aea7652426394d11b19d63130432ad1c
msgid ""
"When this reversed polarized signal arrives at your receiving antenna it is "
"largely rejected and hugely attenuated, so interfering minimally with the "
"main received signal."
msgstr "这个反向极化信号到达接收天线时会被大量抑制和衰减，从而对主接收信号的干扰降到最低。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:142
#: e518d3558b6e4405a6f6d736ec89ac67
msgid "Resonance and matching issues"
msgstr "谐振与匹配问题"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:144
#: 0d7859c83fe941ce817c480f8ee21fc0
msgid "Most simple linear antenna are either of the monopole or dipole form."
msgstr "大多数简单线性天线要么是单极形式，要么是偶极形式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:146
#: 8ca50e677d0b4cca9cd27550e359c00c
msgid ""
"A single monopole ( 1/4 wave vertical for example) or a single dipole will "
"only radiate linear polarization."
msgstr "单个单极（如 1/4 波长垂直天线）或单个偶极只能辐射线性极化。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:149
#: 9513817e10a644e584635124b3f0503c
msgid ""
"Any antenna is only resonant when it is exactly the correct length AT the "
"frequency of operation."
msgstr "天线只有在工作频率上长度完全正确时才能谐振。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:152
#: ac62c7fbf7e247fa9a4073233f9244a1
msgid ""
"( this does not apply to the class of broadband antenna, such as helical "
"antenna, etc."
msgstr "（这不适用于宽带天线类，如螺旋天线等。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:154
#: 04ca666fc66a44818fc01273e4bd34fe
msgid "The helical will easily cover an ocatve with good performance)."
msgstr "螺旋天线可以在一个倍频程范围内保持良好性能）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:156
#: 9e5c65166d2244f9b0ac92e0a8b5f4c8
msgid ""
"At resonance the antenna will exhibit its characteristic feedpoint "
"impedance."
msgstr "在谐振时，天线会表现出其特征馈电点阻抗。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:159
#: 43ec0d3ad8904c92bc4646df6fbec845
msgid ""
"Feedpoint impedance is expressed with two terms, the pure resistive part, "
"and the reactive ( j operator) part."
msgstr "馈电点阻抗由两部分表示：纯阻性部分和电抗（j 算子）部分。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:162
#: 0d419eced9bf4ae7a76bc6be9a55884a
msgid ""
"Most transmitters and receivers terminal impedance are made to be 50ohms "
"resistive, or very close to that."
msgstr "大多数发射机和接收机的端口阻抗设计为 50 欧姆纯阻性，或非常接近该值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:165
#: 1357608e0dd3499c9ba60a35185382cd
msgid ""
"So it stands to reason the antenna must also be 50 Ohm resistive to have max"
" energy transfer."
msgstr "因此天线也必须为 50 欧姆纯阻性才能实现最大能量传输。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:167
#: 6126be0cd85c4e2395d7b2bc6787f7f2
msgid ""
"However, none of the antenna are that obliging, so we have to do some "
"feedpoint matching to meet the criteria."
msgstr "然而，没有一种天线天生如此，因此我们必须进行一些馈电点匹配以满足要求。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:170
#: 0c2417dc432d4cf1b75197b35ab6cf4c
msgid ""
"A 1/4wave vertical monopole over a ground plane has a resistive feed point "
"of around 75ohms."
msgstr "地平面上的 1/4 波长垂直单极天线的阻性馈电点约为 75 欧姆。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:173
#: 68e4637cfb4f4fe68e93f85eebfdca80
msgid "A half wave dipole is around 72ohms."
msgstr "半波偶极天线约为 72 欧姆。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:174
#: c86b5012eca14eb5b39fc34c9edbaec4
msgid ""
"As with resistors, placing two dipole in parallel as in the IBcrazy "
"turnstile, will result in a feedpoint impedance of 35ohms."
msgstr "与电阻并联类似，IBcrazy 风车天线中两个偶极并联，馈电点阻抗为 35 欧姆。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:177
#: 219d2631b7114df4bfd22a28c9c4609b
msgid ""
"A 75ohm feed connected to a 50ohm coax and transmitter will exhibit a 1.5:1 "
"SWR ( the ratio of power going out to power reflected)."
msgstr "75 欧姆馈电连接到 50 欧姆同轴线和发射机时，SWR（驻波比，即发出功率与反射功率之比）为 1.5:1。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:180
#: e2e5abee222f4192abc3112cc7b9a433
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"A 1.5:1 SWR means that approx 3% of your transmitter power is not being "
"radiated: ( 30milliwatts for a 1watt transmitter)."
msgstr "1.5:1 SWR 意味着大约 3% 的发射机功率未能辐射出去（1W 发射机损失约 30mW）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:182
#: dd9e6968ca674a51b003c3eed4ab1ca7
msgid ""
"That is not so bad, and we can live with an SWR of 1.5:1 in most cases."
msgstr "这并不算太差，大多数情况下我们可以接受 1.5:1 的 SWR。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:185
#: 0d3b59837bb24df3bddeafff62f165d6
msgid ""
"The turnstile antenna is a pair of crossed dipoles, fed 90deg out of phase "
"with each other, thereby generating circular polarisation."
msgstr "风车天线是一对交叉偶极，相互馈电相位差 90 度，从而产生圆极化。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:188
#: e0016571d2c54fafad4c9f67a1f58d6b
msgid ""
"You CANNOT simply connect the dipole in parallel at the coax feedpoint "
"though."
msgstr "但您不能简单地在同轴馈电点将偶极并联。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:190
#: a2e702fb93fc4d6f802029f3431ffb85
msgid ""
"Apart from the halving of impedance ( which we decided we can live with) the"
" radiation pattern and polarization of the antenna will be totally destroyed"
" by unwanted radiation from the coax cable."
msgstr "除了阻抗减半（我们已经决定可以接受）之外，同轴电缆不必要的辐射会完全破坏天线的辐射方向图和极化方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:193
#: 1454163ff49c4294ad9376c7993a6c38
msgid ""
"The RF energy, at the dipole connection point, 'leaks' out and currents then"
" flow down the outer shield of the coax."
msgstr "射频能量在偶极连接点处「泄漏」，电流随后沿同轴线外屏蔽层流动。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:195
#: 302fd0eb2a294a1b8088a116b0888af5
msgid ""
"As mentioned previously, any piece of wire will radiate RF energy, and so "
"the coax radiates this energy, and the radiation again adds constructively "
"and destructively with the main antenna radiation, causes complete "
"distortion and signal nulls in the pattern."
msgstr ""
"如前所述，任何导线都会辐射射频能量，因此同轴线会辐射这部分能量，这些辐射再次与主天线辐射产生相长和相消叠加，导致方向图完全失真并出现信号零点。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:199
#: fe744b0fb2cd484daed029b779c9b251
msgid "This radiation from the coax MUST be prevented."
msgstr "必须防止同轴线上的这种辐射。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:201
#: 68d220f1b5ca4d8b9abc1cb2d4df0571
msgid ""
"This is done by means of a **Balun** transformer. - which is is an acronym "
"for '**Bal**\\ anced to \\ **Un**\\ balanced transformer'."
msgstr ""
"这通过 **Balun** （巴伦）变压器来实现——Balun 是「**Bal**\\ anced to \\ **Un**\\ balanced "
"transformer」（平衡-不平衡变压器）的缩写。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:203
#: 17a56940190d4cd29de11e09aece99e4
msgid ""
"A dipole is a balanced device - it is electrical equal along each element, "
"outwards from the feedpoint. It therefore requires that the feedpoint be fed"
" in a balanced fashion."
msgstr "偶极是一种平衡器件——从馈电点向外，每个振子的电气特性相同。因此要求馈电点以平衡方式馈电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:207
#: 96b728e1f4f048cb88c8b93de19467e5
msgid ""
"Coax cable is a balanced feeder - the shield is at ground potential, while "
"the inner core carries the energy."
msgstr "同轴电缆是不平衡馈线——屏蔽层处于地电位，而内芯承载能量。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:209
#: e333ff30adf4433da053dd477a03db19
msgid ""
"This effectively ( oversimplifying a little) connects the one dipole half to"
" the 'live' core, and the other half to 'ground' unbalancing the dipole."
msgstr "这实际上（稍微简化）将偶极的一半连接到「热」内芯，另一半连接到「地」，使偶极失去平衡。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:212
#: f14f124a3dc84d5eab4347a9f0b765f0
msgid ""
"This causes currents to flow on the coax outer shield, and distortion of the"
" dipole radiation pattern."
msgstr "这导致电流沿同轴线外屏蔽层流动，以及偶极辐射方向图失真。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:215
#: 1e23f94448e340b98c9550a8e696effb
msgid ""
"**Baluns** can be constructed from coax cable, but the accuracy required in "
"coax cable length ( they are normally length multiples of 1/4 wavelength) is"
" very critical, especially in the GHz range - 0.5mm can have a great effect."
msgstr ""
"**Balun** （巴伦）可以用同轴电缆制造，但对同轴电缆长度（通常为 1/4 波长的整数倍）的精度要求非常严格，尤其是在 GHz "
"频率范围内——0.5mm 的误差就会产生很大影响。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:219
#: e5614875d4c1478fb2bffcd873016502
msgid ""
"The **turnstile** is not new - it is some 50 to 60 years old, and is well "
"researched and published."
msgstr "**风车天线** 并不是新发明——它已有 50 至 60 年的历史，有大量研究和发表文献。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:222
#: e999150e53a24b6a9602726e8e8a25a0
msgid ""
"Up to the VHF and lower UHF region , the coax balun, with embedded impedance"
" match transmission line transformer, is used, along these lines:"
msgstr "在 VHF 和较低 UHF 频段，使用内嵌阻抗匹配传输线变压器的同轴巴伦，如下所示："

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:229
#: 4754f7d16b824e8c9f0eba3a4d412018
msgid ""
"For the higher microwave frequencies, a plumbing type version is more "
"appropriate."
msgstr "对于更高的微波频率，管道型版本更为合适。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:232
#: ca722aef4f39483d8535257d80bfa517
msgid ""
"This is called the **spilt tube** or **split sheath** **balun**, and looks "
"like this when used as a feed for a pair of crossed dipoles."
msgstr "这称为 **裂管** 或 **裂鞘** **巴伦**，用作一对交叉偶极馈电时如下图所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:242
#: 395b8eed35e5445dac2e46901ce6d38d
msgid "The balun and feed match consists of an outer and an inner tube."
msgstr "巴伦和馈电匹配由外管和内管组成。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:244
#: 5c583311ea044aaeae589d4c6cfe1e25
msgid "The ratio of diameters D/d is chosen to give the desired impedance:"
msgstr "内外径之比 D/d 的选取决定了所需的阻抗："

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:247
#: 33a5e5a54c434d0daac2f31385cbec17
msgid "D/d = 1.86 for 75ohms, and 1.5 for 50 ohms."
msgstr "D/d = 1.86 对应 75 欧姆，1.5 对应 50 欧姆。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:248
#: 4b7f81dee0e24b32ab2f9112b2fbedae
msgid "Typically the outer tube would be around 8mm for use at 2.4GHz."
msgstr "通常外管外径约为 8mm，用于 2.4GHz 频段。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:249
#: be5cfa68e2b34d89b3b963ffe8ce182d
msgid ""
"In order to obtain circular polarisation, I mentioned that the two dipole "
"have to be fed 90deg apart ( phase quadrature)."
msgstr "为了获得圆极化，我提到两个偶极必须以 90 度相位差（正交相位）馈电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:251
#: e8d29f945e35424290bd79591ab2ac2d
msgid ""
"This can be done as in the coax balun version above ( inserting an extra "
"1/4wave length of coax in the leg to one dipole gives an extra electrical "
"wavelegnth of 90 degerees)."
msgstr "这可以像上述同轴巴伦版本那样实现（在通向一个偶极的馈线中插入额外的 1/4 波长同轴电缆，使电气波长多出 90 度）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:254
#: 548d9d95ab2f435186e5c055df1906de
msgid ""
"Or, this can be achieved by slightly lengthening the one element ( becomes "
"more inductive) and shortening the other( becomes more capacitive) - this "
"also introduces the required phase difference between the elements."
msgstr "或者，可以通过稍微加长一个振子（变得更具感性）和缩短另一个（变得更具容性）来实现——这也在振子之间引入了所需的相位差。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:258
#: 1ab921509ff1409f99b4638296858cc2
msgid "This can be seen in the images above:"
msgstr "这可以在上述图片中看到："

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:260
#: 7d707391280945e6bf3a799a8b698bf1
msgid ""
"The one element is typically around 0.21 wavelength per half, while the "
"other is around 0.25 wavelength."
msgstr "一个振子每半段通常约为 0.21 波长，而另一个约为 0.25 波长。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:262
#: 115dbbd3c1da470aa180ae6ac63596df
msgid ""
"One short and one long element penetrate the outer tube and are connected to"
" the inner tube."
msgstr "一短一长的振子穿过外管并连接到内管。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:264
#: 28db2f8b9f4d4f3b9da01028f5058243
msgid ""
"While the opposite pair of elements are connected only to the outer tube."
msgstr "而相对的一对振子仅连接到外管。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:266
#: a9db5611c23f4681a53d8acbe0793638
msgid ""
"The outer tube is split or slotted ( 0.5mm width slot). The slot is approx "
"0.23 wavelength long."
msgstr "外管被劈开或开槽（槽宽约 0.5mm）。槽长约为 0.23 波长。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:275
#: 17652dc03fff457189ee94cf489c00e0
msgid "The relationship in length between the two dipoles is critical."
msgstr "两个偶极之间的长度关系至关重要。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:277
#: eeb272c856ff4dbb921a01debc58e908
msgid ""
"Typically this would be measured on a network analyser and the feed "
"impedance of each element set to say R+j45 ohms ( longer dipole) and the "
"other to R-j45 ohms."
msgstr "通常需要用网络分析仪测量，将每个振子的馈电阻抗分别设置为 R+j45 欧姆（较长偶极）和 R-j45 欧姆。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:280
#: 1e29322218ae4145a5ec59e2b3df7d85
msgid "This will give the correct phase relationship between elements."
msgstr "这将在振子之间产生正确的相位关系。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:281
#: 0a455af88f3446ac951df2b7479df540
msgid ""
"A half mm variation can have a great effect, turning a good antenna into a "
"mediocre one.."
msgstr "半毫米的偏差都会产生很大影响，将一根好天线变成平庸的天线。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:284
#: e81285cc4f81442fb3f0ff1920613b2e
msgid "The last image above shows a teflon tube."
msgstr "上面最后一张图片显示了一个聚四氟乙烯管。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:286
#: ce4209250a464120b7d5d1ab00326ba6
msgid ""
"This is inserted in the tube from below, and fits snugly inside the outer "
"tube, and over the inner tube."
msgstr "它从下方插入管中，紧紧套在外管内、内管外。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:288
#: 710ad261c9e249b7895342a78bb107d6
msgid ""
"This is then slid up and down to adjust the 'R' part of R+-jX, till the "
"match is a good 50ohms."
msgstr "然后上下滑动，调整 R±jX 中的「R」部分，直到匹配接近 50 欧姆。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:290
#: 749f4deafd1e420a899aafaa4d4918ab
msgid "This does not affect the antenna radiation pattern or characteristics."
msgstr "这不会影响天线的辐射方向图或特性。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:292
#: f2043e3e2b9d4e348cfe5f50730ca8c9
msgid ""
"Obtaining a 50ohm impedance match can be done by trimming the element "
"lengths as well, at the same time destroying the antenna radiation pattern "
"and circularity."
msgstr "通过修剪振子长度也可以获得 50 欧姆阻抗匹配，但同时会破坏天线辐射方向图和圆极化特性。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:296
#: 466798bbb7aa426884c75320d8e3f199
msgid ""
"And that is why it is not so simple to do at home, and why the 'Hobby King' "
"et al variants sold everywhere are mostly trash."
msgstr "这就是为什么在家中制作并不简单，也是为什么到处销售的「Hobby King」等变体大多是劣质品。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:299
#: f2ffb77c81c14d53908d1b0f9d3730a5
msgid "You will probably achieve a few km range with those."
msgstr "用这些天线您大概能实现几公里的通信距离。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:301
#: 3423f494811d4e27a2b5d9a8fa27611e
msgid "Remember, any old piece of wire will radiate."
msgstr "记住，任何一段普通导线都会辐射。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:302
#: 9d20c878101843ca9bf8c65988e53cea
msgid ""
"I easily achieve 15km with 500milliwats at 2.4GHz using two split sheath "
"balun , properly matched and trimmed, crossed dipoles.."
msgstr "我使用两个裂鞘巴伦、经过正确匹配和修剪的交叉偶极天线，在 2.4GHz 频段以 500mW 功率轻松实现 15km 通信距离。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:306
#: c2e81f0d527f4ab0af5a429ea78cd287
