"subtraction. For example, consider a radio with an output of 60mW which is "
"connected to an antenna with a gain of 14dBi using a 7m cable (attenuation "
"25dB per 100m). We can calculate the output power as shown:"
msgstr ""
"以 dB 或 dBm 表示的功率计算可以使用简单的加减法。例如，一台输出 60mW 的无线电，通过 7m 电缆（衰减 25dB/100m）连接到增益 "
"14dBi 的天线，可以如下计算输出功率："

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:358
#: 169079ae376a48f380d84f1dfa8a3536
msgid ""
"**TX_Power**\\ = 60mW = \\ **0.06W** = **17.78dBm** (using conversions "
"above)"
msgstr "**TX_Power**\\ = 60mW = \\ **0.06W** = **17.78dBm** （使用上述换算）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:361
#: d76b322490ae40ae94f22b059eded05d
msgid "**Cable_Loss** = 25dB/100m = 0.25dB per meter \\* 7 metres = \\ **1.75dB**"
msgstr "**Cable_Loss** = 25dB/100m = 0.25dB/m \\* 7m = \\ **1.75dB**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:364
#: 90a6d1d55d7c4cb8b3ffbf6a964d6cc7
msgid "**Antenna_Gain** = **14dBi**"
msgstr "**Antenna_Gain** = **14dBi**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:366
