msgid "**Output_Power** = **TX_Power** - **Cable_Loss** + **Antenna_Gain**"
msgstr "**Output_Power** = **TX_Power** - **Cable_Loss** + **Antenna_Gain**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-design.rst:368
#: f52983f477d5496e9688a0a58e0e5848
